.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-config\-inspect\-network \- Inspect the network configuration
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq config inspect network\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]  
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Inspect the network configuration.
.PP
Prints the network configuration.  This can be used to gauge the metadata leakage resulting from network operations.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Inspect the network configuration.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq config inspect network
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\-inspect\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
